name: belief-refinement
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a held belief gained precision without being wrong — the commit
      sharpens the boundary of a true claim (scope narrows, a layer is
      named, a mechanism is identified) rather than revoking it.
      Distinct from belief-revision (the prior claim was measured
      false), belief-flip (the direction reversed), and belief-change
      (generic umbrella — prefer this or the specific ones when the
      shape of the motion is known).
